# "Sandman's power and toughness are each equal to the number of lands you control": on turn 3 Bot1 has two Forests, a Mox Jet (an artifact, not a land) and Sandman,
# and Bot2 has a Plains (not Bot1's): so Sandman is 2/2, not 3/3 and not 1/1. "Sandman can't be blocked by creatures with power 2 or less": Bot2's Containment
# Priest (power 2) cannot block it (the refusal) and Cathar Commando (power 3) can (the positive control); the 2/2 and the 3/1 kill each other.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Sandman, Shifting Scoundrel
Forest
Island
Island
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Black Lotus
Containment Priest
Cathar Commando
Plains x15

